# Line-ending rules for the PUBLISHED bundle repo.
#
# This file must ship INSIDE the bundle, because the publish copies only the
# bundle directory into the target repo — the monorepo's root .gitattributes
# never gets there. Without these rules git normalizes run_gate.cmd to LF on
# commit, and cmd.exe cannot parse an LF-only batch file (it executes fragments
# of it). Found 2026-08-15; the marketplace had been storing it LF-only.
#
# Generated bundles are LF everywhere else, deliberately.
*               text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
